<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-PROFILE OF WORLD MEN'S JAVELIN CHAMPION CORBETT.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-PROFILE OF WORLD MEN'S JAVELIN CHAMPION CORBETT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Profile of Marius Corbett, who won the world men's javelin title on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Born October 26, 1975. Potchefstroon, South Africa.</p>
<p>Won the world junior title in 1994. </p>
<p>Had a personal best of 77.98 metres before this year. Improved ths mark to 83.90 early in the season then to 88.90 in Tuesday's final.</p>
<p>Has trained with world record holder Jan Zelezny in Cape Town.</p>
</text>
